// Vessel Archive  -  full site, ported into Framer with the original design untouched.
// The original HTML, CSS and JS are embedded verbatim below. Nothing has been
// re-styled, re-timed or re-approximated.
//
// SEO ARCHITECTURE (Sept 2026)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The site used to be a hash-routed SPA: every Framer page rendered the homepage
// markup plus nine hidden <template> blocks, and the browser swapped content in
// after load. Google saw the same page at nine URLs and no crawlable internal
// links (they were all href="#/work" style).
//
// Now each Framer page sets the `route` prop. The component server-renders ONLY
// that route's <main>, with one <h1>, and every internal link is a real path
// (/work, /about, /work/elysian ...). Legacy hash links from the old build
// (vessel-archive.com/#/work) still work: the script redirects them to the real
// page. In-page anchors use plain hashes (/work#reel).
