// right after first paint on every device (poster first), never under prefers-reduced-motion
// or Save-Data. A small TAP FOR SOUND pill replaces the big play orb. Without JS the card still links to /work#reel.
// URLS: framerusercontent.com assets uploaded to the Design page (matched by file hash, Sep 25).
// The video files were not found on the Design page yet, so the video constants are "" for now.
